# Kamal secrets. Runtime secrets are NOT here: they live on the VPS in
# /etc/eduskript/{app,db,caddy}.env (root:deploy 640) and Docker reads them via
# env-file in config/deploy.yml, so a deploy from any machine never pushes
# secrets. Edit them there, then restart the container (scripts/ops/README.md).
# Only the build secret is needed here; bin/kamal fetches it from the VPS.
NEXT_SERVER_ACTIONS_ENCRYPTION_KEY=$NEXT_SERVER_ACTIONS_ENCRYPTION_KEY
